entityDescription:
We believe in helping the good guys win. To advance our cause, we have created Quorum Cyber: a community of likeminded individuals passionate about defending Customers against Cyber Security breaches and attacks, ensuring they can confidently operate in an increasingly hostile digital landscape.
Born in 2016 and with headquarters in Edinburgh, we serve Customers globally a collection of simple, clear, and innovative Professional and Managed Security Services, delivered through our own platform Clarity.
Our products and services have been developed by our in-house teams, people with a track record of delivering Cyber Security into large enterprise organisations across the world such as banks, global cloud providers, and global brands.
The SOC service delivers the following Business and Security outcomes:
&middot; Proactive incident detection, response and containment (no hidden fees);
&middot; 24x7x365 service delivered entirely by a local UK team based in Scotland;
&middot; Powered by Microsoft Azure Sentinel;
&middot; Integrating Public and Private Threat Intelligence Platforms;
&middot; Leveraging the latest Security Orchestration, Automation and Response (SOAR) capabilities by the implementation of Azure Sentinel Playbooks;
&middot; Machine Learning and Artificial Intelligence Behavioural Analytics, enhancing the effectiveness and efficiency of our teams;

